'''Sanaüja''' ({{IPA|ca|sanaˈuʒa}}) is the [[W:At-large|at-large]] [[Commune district|legislative district]] for the [[Sanaüja|eponymous]] [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]]/city, within [[Dríadas]] (35) region. Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the [[W:Instant-runoff voting|instant-runoff voting]] system.

